&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;596u6-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In this role, you will lead the IAM team within the Elastic Cloud, guiding an accomplished group as they work to modernize our identity and access management systems. You’ll have the chance to oversee and support a distributed high-performance team that is tackling an ambitious &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:rr:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-cua023&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;596u6-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;596u6-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, making a real impact on how we manage user identities and access. If you&#39;re looking to help shape and improve crucial systems while fostering collaboration and innovation, this position offers a great opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;78v3u-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;78irq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;78v3u-0-0&quot;&gt;
