&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5agq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4ee9-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4ee9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4ee9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proficient architecture and system-design judgment, including in large, existing codebases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5agq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ankh8-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ankh8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ankh8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Successfully designed and launched multiple user interface components that significantly increased user commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5agq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;49vbs-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;49vbs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;49vbs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You should have experience using AI-assisted development tools. These tools can help you develop features faster, fix complex systems, and improve existing codebases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
